<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:17:52 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>技术行业领导者承认“没有什么是面向未来的”——但人工智能无法取代美国对汽车技术人员等蓝领工人不断增长的需求</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/skilled-trades-work-augmented-but-not-replaced-by-ai-six-figure-salary-potential-opportunity-for-gen-z-ford-carhartt-jobs-for-the-future/</link><description>福特和 Carhartt 领导人表示，人工智能将增加蓝领工作岗位，但不会改变行业每年填补 170 万个熟练劳动力岗位的需求。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/55659066376_0a7444752c_o-e1795017049196.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:20:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/skilled-trades-work-augmented-but-not-replaced-by-ai-six-figure-salary-potential-opportunity-for-gen-z-ford-carhartt-jobs-for-the-future/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普表示，如果没有外国学生，大学将“很快走向地狱”。新入学人数下降了 18%，学费损失数十亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/international-students-enrollment-drop-open-doors-trump-colleges-tuition/</link><description>硕士课程流失了 22% 的国际学生。根据《财富》杂志的计算，学费损失至少为 15 亿美元。学校正在裁员或关闭。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/GettyImages-2216820238-e1763394521955.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:21:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/international-students-enrollment-drop-open-doors-trump-colleges-tuition/</guid></item><item><title>千禧一代在为人父母的阶段正在“哄孩子”，他们把空闲时间花在盲盒和抓娃娃机上</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/20/millennials-kidulting-harris-poll-nostalgia-blind-box-arcade-claw/</link><description>哈里斯民意调查公司首席战略官利比·罗德尼 (Libby Rodney) 向《财富》杂志谈到“盲盒”的吸引力时表示：“它具有与老虎机相同的心理吸引力。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2232911462-e1792501450813.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:30:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/20/millennials-kidulting-harris-poll-nostalgia-blind-box-arcade-claw/</guid></item><item><title>“罗马人在嘲笑我们”：物理人工智能创始人筹集了 9700 万美元，以停止在陈旧的基础设施维护上浪费时间</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/brightai-alex-hawkinson-physical-ai-unicorn-roman-infrastructure-inspections/</link><description>BrightAI 的 Alex Hawkinson 告诉《财富》杂志：“我认为我们可以改造当前的世界。” “你不需要从头开始重建一切。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/alex-hawkinson.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/brightai-alex-hawkinson-physical-ai-unicorn-roman-infrastructure-inspections/</guid></item><item><title>机器人笼斗和吸食纳米粒子：来自硅谷人工智能前沿“现实扭曲场”的笔记</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/san-francisco-silicon-valley-ai-boom-humanoid-robots-brain-computer-interfaces/</link><description>在旧金山，有关智力、意识和人类理解极限的问题贯穿于生活的各个方面。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Fortune_AI-Boom-animated-web-smaller-1.gif?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/san-francisco-silicon-valley-ai-boom-humanoid-robots-brain-computer-interfaces/</guid></item><item><title>价值 9.7 亿美元的 Pacsun 首席执行官表示，Alpha 世代和 Z 世代“被严重误解”，因此她成立了一个由 12 至 22 岁的人组成的董事会来为她提供建议</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/15/ceo-of-pacsun-brieane-olson-says-gen-alpha-gen-z-are-greatly-misunderstood-made-board-of-13-to-22-year-olds-give-advice/</link><description>Pacsun 首席执行官布里安·奥尔森 (Brieane Olson) 表示，如果领导者倾听 Z 世代和 Alpha 世代的意见，而不是否定他们，他们将获得“更好的回报”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2270925752-e1794504122435.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/15/ceo-of-pacsun-brieane-olson-says-gen-alpha-gen-z-are-greatly-misunderstood-made-board-of-13-to-22-year-olds-give-advice/</guid></item><item><title>由于人工智能“迅速转向”债务融资，欧洲央行认为“与互联网泡沫和次贷泡沫存在历史相似之处”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/ecb-financial-stability-review-ai-debt-subprime-2008-off-balance-sheet/</link><description>欧洲央行从大型科技公司的账簿中计算出超过 4 万亿美元的人工智能承诺，并将其繁荣程度与 2008 年之前的水平进行了比较。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2304124854-e1795015437137.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:50:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/ecb-financial-stability-review-ai-debt-subprime-2008-off-balance-sheet/</guid></item><item><title>密西西比州政府表示人工智能基础设施消息传递在不再具有必要性时就会变质：“美国每个人都定期使用数据中心”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/mississippi-governor-data-center-messaging-midterm-elections/</link><description>“就日常美国公民的必要性和需要而言，毫无疑问，有必要保留这些数据，”州长泰特·里夫斯告诉《财富》杂志。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/55658026502_fa8f14280a_o.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:49:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/mississippi-governor-data-center-messaging-midterm-elections/</guid></item><item><title>“我很遗憾地说，这只是开篇”：美国 4 个主要系统在 6 天内崩溃后，顶级网络专家警告称将出现“漏洞末日”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/nicole-perlroth-vulnpocalypse-outages-rubio-microsoft-faa-nsa/</link><description>美国国务卿马可·卢比奥表示，美国“没有受到系统性攻击”。有关错误和补丁的数据表明，这对公司来说并没有多大安慰。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305122324-e1795014801584.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:42:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/nicole-perlroth-vulnpocalypse-outages-rubio-microsoft-faa-nsa/</guid></item><item><title>黄仁勋和 Nvidia 并不是一个蜜罐故事。这是一个国家安全的故事</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/nvidia-jensen-huang-megaspeed-honeypot-national-security-export-controls-andrew-king/</link><description>埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 对我们对硅谷“性战争”的研究做出了回应，他说：“如果她是 10 分，那么你就是一笔资产。”我们认为这太简单了。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2299714527_26bdbe-e1794935910332.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:36:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/nvidia-jensen-huang-megaspeed-honeypot-national-security-export-controls-andrew-king/</guid></item></channel></rss>